hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"979","Salam bin Junada told us, Waki` told us, Muhammad bin Isa told us, Ibn al-Mubarak told us both, on the authority of Ibrahim bin Tahman, On the authority of Hussein Al-Muallem, on the authority of Abdullah bin Buraidah, on the authority of Imran bin Husayn, he said: I had a fistula, so I asked the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, about Prayer, and he said: “Pray standing, and if you are not able, then sitting, and if you are not able, then on your side.” And Muhammad bin Issa said, he said: I had hemorrhoids. So I mentioned that to the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace."
